  "reviewSummary": "Reviewed the direct Tezos X roadmap at /tezos-x/ after the prior URL returned HTTP 302. The roadmap lists the May testnet as Live and Q3 mainnet activation as Planned. The docs describe an upcoming launch. Octez 25.3 and EVM node 0.67 have published releases, protected tags and binaries. Checked the complete FAST (28), SLOW (17) and Sequencer (2) archives, the Ganesha proposal, and the retained deployment and maintenance receipts. The August 29 operator receipt confirms kernel 7.1 on mainnet. The November 4 maintenance completed, and incident 1115435 records both L2 TzKT explorers recovering at 15:14:22 UTC. The operator currently reports operational status and all 28 reports resolved. Full Tezos X rollout remains unconfirmed.",
